[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12400100_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12400100_01_0010","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12400100_01_0020","text":"日花，差不多该──\n……咦，怎么了？　脸色这么难看"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12400100_01_0030","text":"……没什么"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12400100_01_0040","text":"您是想说我的脸很糟糕吗～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12400100_01_0050","text":"不，不是那个意思……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12400100_01_0060","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12400100_01_0070","text":"……化得很好哦\n不用担心也不用紧张"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12400100_01_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12400100_01_0080","text":"带着日花你特有的好表情去吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12400100_01_0090","text":"……啧，说我特有……\n那不就是说我的脸很糟糕吗，没问题吧……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12400100_01_0100","text":"服装很可爱，我会好好衬托它的～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12400100_01_0101","text":"Motion"}]
